props.description:
Column counts, responding to the grid's own width (container queries):
a number, or `{ base, sm, md, lg }` (480 / 768 / 1200px). Integers 1-12;
other values throw a RangeError.

Secondary text rendered after the main slot (or the `aside` slot).
Without both, the aside column is omitted (single full-width column);
`0` is valid content.
